homepage_url: https://github.com/NixOS/nix

notes: |
    This is a Python port of the version comparison algorithm implemented in
    compareVersions and componentsLT in src/libstore/names.cc of Nix, exposed
    in the Nix language as builtins.compareVersions. The port is validated
    against the reference implementation over an exhaustive pair fixture, see
    tests/data/schema/nix_version_cmp.json and etc/scripts/gen_nix_version_cmp.py.

notice_file: nix.py.NOTICE
